        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<h1>AJ Control Center</h1><p>Alle v\u00e6rkt\u00f8jer, databaser og pipelines samlet \u00e9t sted. V\u00e6lg et v\u00e6rkt\u00f8j nedenfor. Eksterne GUI\u2019er \u00e5bner i en ny fane.</p><p><strong>F\u00e6lles administrator:</strong> admin \u00b7 brug samme lokale kodeord i v\u00e6rkt\u00f8jerne. Headlamp bruger lokal l\u00e6seadgang. Kubernetes-workloads kan st\u00e5 i standby, mens Compose k\u00f8rer.</p>"
      }
    },
